			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Cocoon and Common submodules — rebuild and doc fix\n\nAdvance Cocoon to include a rebuild of Target/ JS bundles, source maps, and RouteManifest timestamp with no new RPC methods — Mountain method count remains at 140.\n\nAdvance Common to correct the inline completion provider doc comment, clarifying that `ProvideInlineCompletionItems` serves any extension via the provider registry pattern (not exclusively AI assistants), improving trait documentation accuracy for Mountain and Wind implementors.\n\nBoth are non-functional changes: rebuilt artifacts and documentation correction.",
